phdlogview for Debian

This package contains upstream code versioned 0.6.5 with two patches:

 * fix-sizer-flags: removes sizer flags that wxWidgets 3.2 (the version
   in Debian trixie) reports with assertion dialogs at startup, because
   upstream was written for wxWidgets 3.0, which was more permissive.
 * fix-button-sizes: lets buttons size themselves to their content,
   because the fixed sizes chosen by upstream leave them empty with
   GTK3 themes.

Neither patch changes the program's behaviour.
Windows runtime DLL are removed from original sources.

 -- Matteo Piscitelli <matteo@matteopiscitelli.it>  Fri, 16 Nov 2026 13:17:01 +0100
